<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="AMO" style="id">Amos</book>
  <para style="h">Amos</para>
  <para style="toc1">Amos</para>
  <para style="toc2">Amos</para>
  <para style="mt">Amos</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hi thu cu Tekoa khuami tuukhal Amos ih simmi a si. Linghnin hlan kum hnih, Judah siangpahrang ah Uzziah a si ih Israel siangpahrang ah Joash ih fapa Jeroboam a si laiah Pathian in Israel thuhla Amos hnenih a langtermi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amos in, “ Bawipa cu Zion ihsin a hrum durdo; A aw cu Jerusalem ihsin khawri bangin a thang. Tuu an tlannak hrampi a ro ṭheh, Karmel Tlang parih hrampi an caar zo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Damaskas khuami pawl atu le tu an sual ruangah ka hrem ding. Gilead mi pawl zaangfahnak nei loin thir ha bunmi fangrialnak thingtum thawn an rialsiat hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Curuangah Syria siangpahrang Hazael inn parah meisa ka thlak ding ih siangpahrang Benhadad ih ral ṭannak pawl a kaang ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Damaskas kotka pawl ka khiak ṭheh ding ih Betheden uktu le Aven phairawn ih um pawl ka dawihlo hai ding. Syria rammi pawl Kir ramah salih hruai ṭheh an si ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Gaza mi pawl cu atu le tu an sual ruangah ka hrem tengteng ding. An miphun pumpi in Edom ram ah sal ah an zuar ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Curuangah Gaza ih khawkulhnak phardawl parah meisa ka run thlak ding ih an inn ṭha pawl hmuah thawn a kaang theh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ashkelon khua uktu pawl cu ka hlon ding. Ekron khua cu ka hrem ding ih a taanglai mi Filistin pawl cu an thi ṭheh ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bawipa in, “ṭai-ar khua mi pawl cu atu le tu an sual ruangah ka hrem tengteng ding. An miphun pumpi in Edom ram ah salah an hruai ṭheh. Pawlkomnak thukam an tuahmi cu an thlun lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Curuangah Ṭaiar khua ih khaw kulhnak phardawl pawl parah meisa ka run thlak ding ih an inn ṭha pawl hmuah thawn a kaang ṭheh ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Edom mi pawl cu atu le tu an sual ruangah ka hrem tengteng ding. An unau Israel mi pawl zaangfahnak nei loin nam thawn an dawi. An thinhengnak cu tawp ti a nei lo ih a reh thei dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Curuangah Teman khua parah meisa ka run thlak ding ih Bozrah inn ṭha pawl a kaang ṭheh ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Ammon mi pawl cu atu le tu an sual ruangah ka hrem tengteng ding. Mi ram an nor ih ral an do tikah Gilead ah favun nunau pawl an raithlek ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Curuangah Rabbah khua ih khawkulhnak phardawl parah meisa ka run thlak ding ih an inn ṭha pawl a kaang theh ding. Cule raldo awk ni ahcun aunak a tam ding ih an do awknak cu thlisia bangin a hrang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An siangpahrang le a kut hnuai bawi pawl salah an kai ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Moab mi pawl cu atu le tu an sual ruangah ka hrem tengteng ding. Edom siangpahrang ih ruh cu an ur ciam ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Curuangah Moab ram parah meisa ka run thlak ding ih Kerioth ih inn ṭha pawl a kaang ṭheh ding. Moab mi pawl cu raldo-awk laifang, ralkap pawl an au ciamco lai le tawtawrawt aw a than rero laifangah an rak thi rero ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Moab ram uktu le an ram sungih hotu pawl hmuahhmuah khal ka that ṭheh ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Judah mi pawl cu atu le tu an sual ruangah ka hrem tengteng ding. Ka thuzirhmi an nautat ih ka thukham pawl an thlun lo. An pupa pawl ih rak biakmi pathian deu pawl in an hruai sual a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Curuangah Judah parah meisa ka run thlak ding ih Jerusalem inn ṭha pawl an kaang theh ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Israel mi pawl cu atu le tu an sual ruangah ka hrem tengteng ding. Mi fel a si khalle leiba a sam thei lotu pawl le kedam tuak khat man a pe thei lotu pawl kha sal ah an zuar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawmtu nei lo le mi ṭawnṭai pawl leivut lakah an palcih ih mi farah pawl lamzin ihsin an tul hlo. Pa le fa in nunau pakhat an sualpi ih cuti cun ka hmin thianghlim an borhhlawhter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Biaknak hmunkip ah mi farah hnen ihsin leiba ai-ih an lakmi puan an phah ih an it. Tangka baaktu pawl hnen ihsin paisa an kuantermi in zu an lei ih an Pathian biakinn sungah an in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Asinain ka miphun pawl, nanmah ih hrangah sokhaw sidar thing bangin a saangmi le sasua thing bangin a hakmi Amor mi pawl ka siatsuah ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Izipt ram ihsin ka lo hruaisuak ih thlaler ramṭhing ah kum sawmli sung ka lo khor. Cule Amor mi pawl ih ram cu nan ta dingah ka lo pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nan fapa ṭhenkhat pawl profet ah ka hril ih nan mino ṭhenkhat pawl Nazir mi ah ka hril. Asilo nan ti thei ding maw, Israel mi pawl? Bawipa keimah in ka sim zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Asinain cuih Nazir mi pawl cu zu nan inter ih profet pawl ka thu aupi lo dingin nan kham.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Curuangah atu-ah leilung ah ka lo namcih ding ih rawl ritzet a phurtu cawleng awn bangin nan hrum nan ai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tlan cakzet pawl hman an luat thei lo ding; mi cakzet pawl an thazaang a ṭum ding ih ralkap pawl hman an nunnak an hum-aw thei lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Li le thal a hmangtu pawl hman an ṭang thei lo ding; tlan cak bik hman an luat lo ding ih rangralkap pawl tla an luat ce lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cuih ni ahcun ralṭha bik ralkap hman in an hriamnam an hlonta ding ih an tlan hlo ding,” a ti. Bawipa in a sim zo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Israel mi pawl, Izipt ram ihsin nan miphun pumpi in Bawipa in a lo hruaisuak zo ih nanmah ih thuhla ah a simmi hi ngaihnik uh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Leilung tlun miphun hmuahhmuah lakah nanmah lawng hi ka theih mi le ka kilkhawi mi nan si. Cucing in nan sual; curuangah ka lo hrem ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lungkim tlang loin mi pahnih hmunkhat ah khual an tlawng tlang thei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kiosa cu dehmi sa nei loin tupi sungah a huuk maw? Kiosa no cu dehmi sa nei loin a kua sungah a hngirhngir maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vate cu thang tarh um loin awh a theih maw? Thang cu a pelhtertu um loin a pelh thei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Raldonak tawtawrawt khua sungih an tum tikah khawsungmi thinphang loin an um maw? Bawipa ih thlenter loin khawsungah harsatnak a thleng dah maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa in a riantu profet pawl hnenah a tumtahmi phuangta loin hna a ṭuan dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kiosa a hrum tikah zoso ṭih loin a um thei? Cungnungbik Bawipa a ṭong tikah tlang-aupi loin zoso a um thei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Izipt le Ashdod siangpahrang inn sungih um pawl hnenah, “Samaria kimvel ih tlang ah tongkhawm aw uhla cutawkih thil sualral an tuahmi le a sungih hnahnawhnak nasa zet tla hi zohhnik uh,” tiin than uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Himi pawl in an siangpahrang inn sung cu sualralnak le thisen luannak thawn an lakmi thilri in an khahter. Ziangtiih mifel si ding, ti khal an thei nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Curuangah an ram ral in an kulh ding. An ṭankhuarnak hmun pawl an siatsuah ding ih an siangpahrang inn cu an ram ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Tuukhal in kiosa ih dehmi tuu a hawl tikah a ke pahnih le a hna lawng a runsuak vekin Samaria khua ih um Israel mi pawl khal an todan kil le an ihkhun ke thawn lawng an luat thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ṭhatein ngai uhla Jakob ih tesinfa pawl cu ralrinnak thu sim uh,” tiah Cungnungbik Ziangkimtithei Bawipa in a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“An sualnak ruangih Israel ka hrem ni ah Bethel ih biakṭheng pawl khal ka siatsuah ṭheh ding. Biakṭheng ih ki pawl khal ka khiak ding ih leilung ah an tla ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ṭhal inn siseh, thlatang inn siseh ka balsiat ṭheh ding. Saiho ih ceimawimi inn pawl le inn tumpi dang pawl khal ka siatsuah ṭheh ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hi thu hi ngaihnik uh, nannih Samaria nunau pawl, cawmthaumi Bashan cawpi pawl, mi nauta pawl a rialbek ih mi farah a namnehtu le “In ding i pe aw,” tiih mahih pasal a auh hluahhlotu pawl,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa in a thianhlimnak thawn, “Sio thawn an lo dirh caan a ra thleng leh ding; nan zatein nga sio ih awkmi nga vek nan si ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A nai bik phar-ong ah an lo hnuk ding ih cutawkin khawleng ah Harmon lamah an lo hlon ding,” tiah siatcam in thu a kam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Maw Israel mi pawl, Bethel ih hmunthiang ah va feh uhla nan duh ahcun va sual uh! Gilgal tla ah va feh uhla nan sual thei tawkin va sual uh. Nan raithawinak ṭilva pawl cu zingkhat hnu zingkhat hei keng uhla nan thawhlawm khal ni thumnak tinte hei keng ringring uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nan sang kha lungawinak in Pathian hnenah hei pe uhla thawhlawm a hlei ih nan thawhmi khal tluangkhawnpi ciamco uh. Cupawl a si lo sawm a tuah nan hiar mi cu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Nan khua hmuahhmuah ah paam a tlun tertu cu keimah ka si. Cu hmanah ka hnenah nan ra kir lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nan lo rawl in ruahti a ṭul bik laiah ruah sur loin ka umter. Khua pakhat ah ruah ka surter ih a dang khua pakhat ahcun ka surter lo. Lo pakhat in ruah a ngah naón a dang pakhat cu vanruah loin a caar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Minung tampi cu khua dangih tidai in dingah hawl rero in an feh. Asinain in khop an hmu lo. Cu cingin ka hnenah nan ra kir cuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Nan lo rawl a ngautertu dingah thlisa ka hranter. Kharbok in nan hmuan le nan sabit hmuan, nan theipi kung le olif kung pawl khal a ei ṭheh. Sikhalsehla ka hnenah nan ra kir duh cuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Izipt ramih ka rak thlenter bangin nan parah pulhnat ka thlenter. Raldonak ah nan mino pawl ka thihter ih nan rang cak zetzet ka lak hlo. Nan hnarkua cu nan riahnak hmun ih miruak thu rim in ka khahter ṭheh. Cu khalah ka hnenah nan ra kir duh cuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Sodom le Gomorrah ka siatsuah bangin nanmah lakih mi ṭhenkhat pawl ka siatsuah. Atuih a nungmi nannih pawl hi meisa sung ihsin thursuakmi a alh laimi funghreu bangtuk nan si. Sikhalsehla ka hnenah nan ra duh cuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Curuangah sokhaw maw Israel mi pawl, ka lo hrem ding ka ti cu! Cutiih ka tuah ding ruangah nan Pathian tong dingah timtuah cia in um uh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian cu tlangsaang pipi tuahtu a si; Thli tuahtu khal a si. A ruahmi cu minung a theihter; Sun cu zan ah a canter; Leilung hmunsang a pal ṭheh. A hmin cu Cungnungbik Bawipa Pathian a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Israel mi pawl, mithi phumnak hla ka lo saksanmi hi ngaihnik uh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Fala him Israel cu a cem zo, A tho sal nawn lo ding. Leilung ah a ril zo, Amah thotu an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa in, “Israel ramsung khua pakhat in ralkap thawngkhat a thlah; asinain zakhat lawng an ra tlung. Khua dang pakhat in zakhat a thlah ih pahra lawng an ra kir,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa in Israel mi hnenah, “Ka hnenah ra kir uhla nan nung ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khawzing biak dingah Beersheba ah feh hlah uh; Bethel ah i hawl duh hlah uh; Bethel cu zianghman a si lo ding. Gilgal khalah va feh hlah uh; a minung pawl sal ah hruai an si ṭheh ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa hnenah feh uhla nan nung ding. Nan feh lo asile nan parah meisa hlio bangin Bawipa a thleng ding. Bethel mi pawl cu meisa in a kaang ding; zohman in an hmit thei lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Dingthluk lairelnak kha merh tahrat in felnak kha leiah a deengtu nannih pawl cu nan cem ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa in arsi tla a tuah, Siruk rawlṭawm le zaangkhua pawl; Thimnak cu sun nitleu ah a tuah, Sun cu zan ah a canter. Tifinriat tidai pawl a ko ih Leilung parah a toih. A hmin cu Bawipa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Micak pawl le an ṭanhmun ralhruang pawl cu a siatsuah ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nannih pawl cun thuṭhennak zungih dinglonak a phuangtu le thudik a reltu pawl nan hua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi rethei zonzai pawl nan namsuk ih an rawl nan long. Curuangah nan sakmi lungto inn ṭhaṭha sungah hin nan um lo ding ih sabit hmuan mawi sungih nan ciinmi sabitti nan in lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nan sualnak tuksumza a sizia le thil sual nan tuahmi a tam zia hi ka thei ṭheh. Miṭha nan hrem, nawhthuh nan la ih farah zonzai pawl parah dingthluk lairelnak thawn thu nan rel lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Curuangah cuih tikcu caan ahcun thuruat thiam mifim pawl cu daitein an rak um. Ziangahtile cuih caan cu caan sia a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thil ṭha lo bansan in thil ṭha tuah uh; cuti asile nan nung ding. Ziangkimtithei Bawipa Pathian cu kan hnenah a um nan ti vekin a um ngaingai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thil ṭha lo hua uh, thilṭha duh uh; thuṭhennak zungah dingthluk lairelnak kha lal seh. Cuti asile Josef hrin a taangsun parah Bawipa in zaangfahnak a nei hrih ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Curuangah Cungnungbik Bawipa Ziangkimtithei in, “Khawsung lamzin ah ṭahnak le ai-hramnak a um ding. Lothlo pawl an ko ding ih ṭah man pekmi pawl thawn mithi an ṭah tlang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sabit hmuan kip ah ai-hramnak a um ding. Ka lo hrem ding ruangah cupawl cu a kim ṭheh ding,” a ti. Bawipa in a sim zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bawipa ni a hngakhlaptu pawl nan hrangah ṭihnungza a si. Cuih ni in ziangso a lo ṭhathnempi ding? Nan hrangah thimnak ni a si ding, tleunak ni a si lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kiosa ṭih ah a zaam ih savom tongtu bangtuk a si ding. Asilole inn ah ra tlung in phar zuut na khaw rul cuk tongtu bangtuk a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bawipa ni in tleunak si loin thimnak a thlenter. Tleunak malte hman um lo a thim bepbepmi ni a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Biaknak puai nan tuahmi pawl hi ka hua ih ka mit an kem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mei-ur thawinak le sangphut thawinak in rak pekmi pawl hi ka saang lo ding; thawinak hrangah tiah thau zetih nan cawmmi ṭilva pawl khal ka saang lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A ringzetmi nan hla pawl hi bang thlang uh; nan ṭingṭang awn pawl hi ka ngai paih nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Dingthluk lairelnak cu tivapi bangin luang sehla felnak cu a kaang dah lomi ti bangin luang sawnseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Maw Israel mi pawl, hramlak ih kum sawmli sung ka lo hruai laiah khan thawinak le peknak zianghman ka lo ngen lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Atu cu nan khawzing le siangpahrang a si mi Sakkuth zuk le nan arsi khawzing Kaiwan ih lem pawl nan biak ruangah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Damaskas pawnlam ram ah salih ka lo hruai tikah cuih milem pawl cu nan ken ṭheh a ṭul ding,” tiah Bawipa in a ti. A hmin cu Ziangkimtithei Pathian a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zion ah nuam zetih a ummi le Samaria ah hnangam zetih a ummi, miphun pipa Israel hruaitu mi nasa pawl, Israel misenpi ih bomnak duh ah an pan reromi pawl, nan hmakhua a va pit so!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Va feh uhla Kalneh khua khi va zohhnik uh. A tum zetmi Hamath khua le Filistin ram ih Gath khua tla vung zohhnik uh! Hi ram pawl hnakin nannih nan ṭha deuh maw si? Nan ram hi an ram hnakin a kau deuh maw si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Siatnak ni thlen ding hi nan theih duh lo khalle nan thil tuahmi in cuih ni cu a naiter sinsin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ihkhun ṭha zetzet parah a ittu le zauṭheng nuam zetzet ah a zau huahhotu, caw note sa le tuu note sa tlaizet ih a eitu nannih pawl nan hmakhua a va pit so!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />David bangin hla phuah le ṭingṭang tum cu nan duhzet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sabit cu hai tumpipi in nan dawk rero ih rimhmui ṭha bik nan hnih aw rero; a sinan Israel a siatral tikah malte hman nan riah a sia lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Curuangah sal ih feh hmaisa biktu nanmah nan si ding. Nan rawl ei puai le nan nomnak puai pawl a cem ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa Ziangkimtithei Pathian in hi ralrinnak thu cu a pe zo: “Israel ih hngalnak hi ka hua; an inn tum zetzet khal hi ka mitkem zawng a si. An khawpi bik le a sungih ummi thil hmuahhmuah cu ral kut sungah ka pe ṭheh ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Innsang pakhat sungah minung pahra an taang a si khalle an pahra in an thi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mithi ih sungkhat mithivui ṭuanvo neitu in miruak cu inn sung ihsin a la suak ding. Cuih a sungkhat cun innsung ih a taanglai mi pakhatkhat hnenah, “Zotal nan um lai maw?” tiah a vun auh ding. Cutikah aw pakhat in, “Um hlah,” a ti ding. Cule a sungkhat pa cun, “Daite in um aw! Bawipa ih hmin saal hrimhrim lo dingin na ralring pei,” tiah a ti ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa in thu a pek tikah inn tum siseh inn fate siseh siatbal ṭheh an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lungtlep lakah rang an tlan maw? Milai in tifinriat tidai parah cawcang thawn lei an let maw? Asinain nannih in dingnak cu thihsii ah nan canter zo ih a ṭhami cu a ṭha lo ah nan canter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Lodebar khua kan lak thei,” tiah nan porh-aw ciamco. “Karnaim lak dingah cun kan cakzet a si,” nan ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ziangkimtithei Bawipa Pathian amah rori in, “Maw Israel mi pawl, nan ram luahtu dingah ramdang ralkap pawl ka thlah ding. Cuih ralkap cun saklam ah Hamath Tlangkawn ihsin thlanglam ah Arabah phairawn tiang an lo namsuk ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa hnen in langnak pakhat ka hmu. Cuih langnak ahcun siangpahrang ih rawlkung an aat ṭheh ih hrampi a cerh pekte ah Bawipa in kharbok burpi a seemter kha ka hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cuih langnak ka hmuhmi sungah cun kharbok pawl cun ram pumpi sungih thilhring hmuahhmuah an ei ṭheh kha ka hmu. Cutikah kei in, “Maw Cungnungbik Bawipa , na minung pawl hi ngaithiam hram aw. Ziangtin so an nun thei ding? An malzet ih an ṭawnṭai tuk fawn,” tiah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cule Bawipa in a thinlung a thleng ih, “Na hmuh vek cun a si sal lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa hnen in langnak a dang pakhat ka hmu. Bawipa in a minung pawl meisa in hrem a tum kha ka hmu. Cuih meisa cun lei thuai tipithuanthum kha a kaang ṭheh ih leilung khal hun kaang lala ding khi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cutikah kei in, “ Bawipa Pathian, baang aw. Ziangtin so na minung pawl an nun thei ding? An malzet ih an ṭawnṭai tuk fawn,” tiah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cule Bawipa in a thinlung a thleng ih, “Na hmuhmi vek cun a si sal lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa hnen in langnak a dang pakhat ka hmu. Hmuithlurhri hmang ih sakmi inn phar kiangah Bawipa a din kha ka hmu. Cule hmuithlurhri cu a kut sungah a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Amos ziangso na hmuh?” tiah i sut. “Hmuithlurhri,” tiah ka sawn. Cule anih in, “Ka minung Israel mi pawl hi a ding lomi phar vek an si ih an ding lozia langternak ah hi hmuithlurhri hi ka lo hmuh a si. Anmah hrem dingih ka ruah ciami cu ka thleng nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Isaak tesinfa pawl ih Pathian biaknak hmun pawl cu an ṭhing reprep ding. Israel ih hmun thianghlim pawl cu siatsuah ṭheh an si ding. Siangpahrang Jeroboam cithlah pawl ih ram-uknak cu ka cemter ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bethel ih puithiam Amaziah in Israel siangpahrang Jeroboam hnenah thu a than ih, “Amos in Israel misenpi lakah a lo phiar a si. A ṭongmi hin ram pumpi a siatsuah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A simmi cu hiti in a si: ‘Jeroboam cu raldonak ah a thi ding; Israel mi pawl an ram ihsin sal ah hruaihlo an si ding,’ tiah a sim ciamco,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cule Amaziah in Amos hnenah cun, “Nang profet, ṭong nawn hlah; Judah ram ah va kir awla cutawkah thu va sim aw. Anmah in na hlawhman lo pe hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hitawk Bethel ahcun profet ṭong in ṭong nawn hlah. Hitawk cu kan ram pumpi biakinn a si ih siangpahrang ih Pathian biaknak hmun a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cutikah Amos in, “Profet ka si lo; profet ih fapa khal ka si lo; ṭilva khaaltu le theipi kung pawl kilkhawitu ka rak si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Bawipa in ka tuu ka khalhnak ihsin i lak ih a minung Israel hnenih profet hna ṭuan dingah thu i pek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bawipa ih ṭongmi hi ngaihnik! Nang cun Israel miphun engtai in siseh, Isaak miphun engtai in siseh ṭong nawn lo dingah i kham.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cutiih na ti ruangah, nang Amaziah, Bawipa in na hnenah, ‘Na nupi cu khawsungah hlawhhlang ah a cang ding ih na faate pawl ralnam in an thi ding. Nan ram cu ṭhenṭhek ṭheh a si ding ih midang hnenah pek a si ding. Nangmah khal Pathian thei lotu ram, ramdang ah na thi ding. Israel mi pawl hi an ram ihsin sal ah an hruaihlo tengteng ding,’ a ti,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa hnen in langnak a dang pakhat ka hmu. Cuih langnak ahcun a hmin zetmi thingrah bawm khat ka hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Amos, ziangso na hmuh?” tiah i sut. “Thingrah hminzet bawm khat,” tiah ka sawn. Cutikah Bawipa in, “Ka minung Israel mi pawl an cem ni a thleng zo. Anmah hrem ka tumnak thinlung ka thleng nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cuih ni ah biakinn sungih hla saknak pawl cu ṭahnak aw ah a cang ding. Hmunkip ah miruak an um ding. A dai khepkhep ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngaihnik uh, nannih mi tlasam a palcihtu le ramsung mi rethei zonzai siatsuah a tumtu pawl!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nan thinlungte cun, “Zarh ni a sau tuk, kan hngak thei lo; kan rawl zuar kan duh thlang. Ziangtikah so Sabbath ni a cem ding ih thil kan zuar thei sal ding? Kan thil man cu a hlei in kan ngen ding ih thil tahnak le khing thlainak pawl cu kan thil leitu pawl bumnak ah a dik lo in kan tuah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A sia bik sangvut hman cu man tamzet ah kan zuar ding. Leiba nei ih kedam tuak khat man hman a pe thei lotu mi farah kan hawl ding ih sal zuat dingah kan lei ding,” tiah nan ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa Israel ih Pathian in siatcam thukam in, “Sualnak an tuahmi cu ka hngilh dah lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Curuangah leilungpi hi a hnin ding ih hi ramsung minung hmuahhmuah zonzaihnak an tuar ding. Hi ram pumpi hi a hnin ṭheh ding ih Nail Tivapi bangin a ṭum tawk le a kai tawk a um ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cuih ni ahcun sun laifang ah ni ka tlakter ding ih sun nitleu laiah khua ka thimter ding. Cungnungbik Bawipa keimah in ka ti a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nan puai pawl cu mithi vuinak ah ka canter ding ih nan lungawinak hla cu riahsiat ṭahnak ah ka canter ding. Nan sam ka meetter ṭheh ding ih buri hnipuan ka lo hrukter ṭheh ding. Fapa neihsun a thih ih a nu le a pa an ṭah bangin ka lo ṭapter ding. Cuih ni cu a netnak tiangin a kha zetmi ni a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hi ram sungih paam ka tlunter ding ni a ra thleng cing ding. Mipi pawl cu an ril a rawng ding naón rawl duh rilrawn a si lo ding; an ti a haal ding naón tidai duh tihal a si lo ding. Bawipa ih ṭongkam theih duh rilrawng le tihal an si ding. Cungnungbik Bawipa keimah in ka sim zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi pawl cu saklam in thlanglam ah, nisuahnak in nitlaknak ah an vakvai ding. Khawzakip ah Pathian ih ṭongkam an hawl ding naón an hmu lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cuih ni ahcun fala le tlangval harhdam zet pawl hman tihal in an bah an ril ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Samaria ih milem Ashimah hmin in siat a serhtu pawl, ‘Dan ih khawzing hmin in,’ a titu le ‘Beersheba ih khawzing hmin in,’ a titu pawl cu an bah ding ih an tho sal nawn lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa cu biakṭheng kiangih a din kha ka hmu. Thu a pek ih, “Biakinn ṭhuam lubo pawl kha vua awla innleng tiangin hnin ṭheh seh. Khuai ṭheh awla misenpi ih lu parah tla thluh seh. Midang hmuahhmuah cu ral kut in ka thihter ṭheh ding. Zohman an luat lo ding; pakhat hman an tlansuak lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mithi khua Sheol ih relh tum in leilung vun lai khal hai sehla ka phorhsuak thotho ding. Vancung ih an kai hmanah ka dirthlak thotho ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Karmel Tlang luzim ih an relh hmanah ka hawl ding ih ka kai thotho ding. Ka hnen ihsin an tlan ih tipi thuanthum tawdeng ih an vung relh khalle ti sungih rulpi thu ka pe ding ih ka cukter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An ral pawl in an kai ih ramdang ih an hruaihlo hmanah thah ṭheh dingin an ral pawl thu ka pe ding. Hi minung pawl cu ka mit ṭhep loin ka zoh hai ding; anmah bom ding cu ka tum lo, siatsuah ṭheh ding lawnglawng ka tum a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa Pathian in leilung a run tham; Cutikah leilung cu a hnin ciamco. Leilung tlun mi hmuahhmuah an riah a sia. Leilung pumpi cu Nail Tiva bangin A ṭum tawk, a kai tawk a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa in vancung ah a umnak a tuah; Van cu leilung ih tlunah a kuumpi in a ret. Tifinriat ih tidai pawl cu a ko ih Leilung parah a toih; A hmin cu Bawipa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Maw Israel mipawl, nanmah tlukin Ethiopia mipawl khal ka ruat zet a si. Izipt ram ihsin ka lo hruaisuak bangin Filistin pawl cu Krete ram ihsin ka hruaisuak ih Siria mipawl cu Kir ram ihsin ka hruaisuak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keimah Cungnungbik Bawipa in hi miphun sualral, Israel siangpahrang ram cu ka zoh thup ringring ih leilung par ihsin ka phiat fai ding. Asinain Jakob tesinfa pawl cu an zate cun ka siatsuah lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Thu ka pe ding ih Israel pawl cu khohriik in rawl an hriik vekin ka hriik ding. Mi ṭhahnem lo pawl hlon duh ah miphun tampi lakah ka hriik vivo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka minung lakin, ‘Harsatnak cu Pathian in kan hnenah a thlenter lo ding,’ a titu misual pawl cu ral kut in an thi ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Inn cim bangtuk ih a cim zomi David ram uknak ka dinter salnak ding ni cu a thleng zik thlang. A phar pawl ka rem sal ding ih ka tungding sal ding. Ka sak sal ding ih khuahlan ih a rak si vekin ka siter sal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Curuangah Israel pawl in a taang hrihmi Edom ram cu an neh thluh ding ih ka ta a rak si dahmi miphun hmuahhmuah khal an neh sal thluh ding a si,” a ti. Himi a cantertu ding Bawipa in a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Tikcu a ra thleng ding ih lorawl cu lak cawk lo in a ṭhang ding; Sabit cu sabitti ih tuah cawk loin a zaai ding. Tlangsaangpi ihsin sabit thlum an for thluahthlo ding ih, Tlangpar ihsin tidai bangin a luang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka minung pawl an ram ah ka kirter sal ding; A siat ciami an khua pawl an sak sal ding ih Cutawkah khua an sa ding. Sabit hmuan an tuah ding ih Sabitti an in ding. Hmuan an tuah ding ih an cinmi an ei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An hnenih ka pekmi ram sungah Ka minung pawl ka phun ding ih Phawi sal an si nawn lo ding,” tiah a ti. Bawipa nan Pathian in a sim zo a si.
  </para>
</usx>
